; Behaviour block: the stone head in the wall that shoots arrows (kind 11, rooms 20 and 22)
;
; Used by the stone heads (shaped like a dragon's head) in the right wall of Unexpected gate and Tortured souls
; (attribute $07, handler #R$B5D6). After the 5
; header bytes: attribute, sprite height, width in bytes, then a pointer to the list of its two sprites.
@label=BehaviourStoneHead
b$952F DEFB $00,$00,$07,$07,$02  ; hit box top, left, bottom, right (2-pixel units); slot +$15 (Unknown)
 $9534 DEFB $07,$08,$02  ; attribute, sprite height, width (bytes)
@isub=DEFW BehaviourStoneHead+$A
 $9537 DEFW $9539    ; sprites
 $9539 DEFW $EF3E    ; sprite $EF3E
 $953B DEFW $EF3C    ; sprite $EF3C
